Parent d281007c2 matches the installed node files byte for byte (host.mjs, agent.mjs,
chain.mjs, node-bridge.mjs, partition-offers.mjs, shield-startup.mjs, memory-share.mjs,
wmiserve-run.mjs). The installed partition manager is older: backend.mjs and
wmi-launcher.mjs equal 3eab453d2, and server.mjs / main.mjs are 3eab453d2 plus
local hotfixes (survey snapshot race, partition console logs). Those four files
are overlaid here from root's installed/ snapshot (installed*-manifest.json).
Files root did not snapshot keep d281007c2 content.
